      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:asher_natan_shabbatot">
        <tei:p><j:conditional xml:id="variant_1"><tei:fs type="opensiddur:variant"><tei:f name="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:asher_natan_shabbatot/berakhot_birkat_hamazon"><tei:binary value="true"/></tei:f></tei:fs></j:conditional><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:asher_natan_shabbatot/15"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who gave Shabbosos for rest to His people Israel with love, for a sign and a covenant, and Yomim Tovim for happiness and joy, this day of (name the Yom Tov.) Blessed are You, Adonoy, Sanctifier of Shabbos, Israel, and the seasons.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<j:endConditional target="#variant_1"/>
<j:conditional xml:id="variant_2"><tei:fs type="opensiddur:variant"><tei:f name="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:asher_natan_shabbatot/berakhot_birkat_hamazon_89"><tei:binary value="true"/></tei:f></tei:fs></j:conditional>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:asher_natan_shabbatot/16"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who gave Shabbosos for rest to His people Israel, with love for a sign and a covenant, and Yomim Tovim to Israel, for remembrance. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Sanctifier of Shabbos, Israel, and the Day of Remembrance.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<j:endConditional target="#variant_2"/>
