<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:asher_natan_shabbatot/14"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who gave Shabbosos for rest to His people Israel with love for a sign and a covenant. Blessed are You Adonoy, Sanctifier of Shabbos.
